WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Choose one small goal. A call. A file. Something you want to do.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Try it in a safe space. No real accounts. Nothing to break.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
See what changes. Understand the idea, beyond the button.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Give it a go yourself. No rush. No judgement.
